        "original_id": "f191c3c7-9364-5e26-8aba-7d1a3ad9fba7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Trafigura, Vitol Group\n- People: Tan Chin Hwee, Henk Viëtor, Jacques Detiger\n- Roles: Asia-Pacific Chief Executive Officer\n- Topics: Oil trading, metals trading, commodity trading\n\nFacts:\n- In 1966, Henk Viëtor and Jacques Detiger founded the Vitol Group in Rotterdam.\n- The Vitol Group is a global energy and commodity trading company.\n- Trafigura is the world's second largest private oil trader after Vitol.\n- Trafigura is the world's largest private metals trader.\n- Tan Chin Hwee is the current Asia-Pacific Chief Executive Officer of Trafigura.\n- Tan Chin Hwee is the first Asian to hold the Asia-Pacific Chief Executive Officer position at Trafigura.",
